*Adapted and extended from P. Larson, "Principles of MRI" (MIT License), chapter "MRI System". Changes: added block diagram, supporting subsystems (shims, sequencer, amplifiers, receive chain, Faraday cage, cryo/cooling), quantitative field/frequency table with Python derivations, prescan simulations, field-strength/bore/cost discussion; corrected the "spins release energy" description of signal reception, the "4 components" count, and typos ("dagerous", "maximum maximum").*
